WEBVTT

00:25.280 --> 00:27.720
The right to judge
and punish the wrongdoer

00:33.640 --> 00:35.960
is the righteousness
of the one with authority.

00:41.320 --> 00:43.160
So what will happen

00:45.160 --> 00:47.280
when the authority in power

00:51.240 --> 00:53.080
is the one to be judged?

02:38.120 --> 02:42.280
SCHOOL BUILDING

02:52.400 --> 02:54.640
CONGRATULATIONS!
MISS JUNKO JIRAIYAWAT

02:54.720 --> 02:56.880
GOLD MEDAL
18TH NATIONAL BIOLOGY OLYMPIAD

03:24.120 --> 03:26.440
Are you starting to have doubts
in what you do?

03:31.880 --> 03:36.760
Junko! We're decorating this board.
Could you help us cut the paper?

03:38.880 --> 03:40.600
-Sure.
-Okay.

04:16.600 --> 04:19.680
Hello. I'm Nanno, a new student.

04:20.200 --> 04:21.480
Are you Junko?

04:23.399 --> 04:25.680
Are you the same Junko who won
the gold medal in the Biology Olympiad?

04:28.080 --> 04:29.120
Yes.

04:30.840 --> 04:31.840
You're so good.

04:37.400 --> 04:38.360
Not really.

04:41.280 --> 04:43.680
I just couldn't go out
and play like other kids.

04:44.680 --> 04:47.920
So I had time to read. That's all.

04:51.000 --> 04:54.480
And why are you in a wheelchair?
What happened to your legs?

04:56.800 --> 04:58.400
I've been like this for a long time.

05:01.240 --> 05:03.640
You've been like this for a long time…

05:04.720 --> 05:05.960
So what is it?

05:19.280 --> 05:20.360
It hurts!

05:21.320 --> 05:22.720
Junko, what's wrong?

05:23.400 --> 05:25.600
Hurry up and get her to the infirmary,
to Teacher Waan.

05:30.920 --> 05:33.160
Junko has hemophilia.

05:33.640 --> 05:36.120
When she gets a cut,
the bleeding won't stop.

05:36.920 --> 05:38.640
It's very dangerous, you know.

05:39.440 --> 05:42.000
The harder she hits something,
the more dangerous it is.

05:42.080 --> 05:43.960
That can be fatal.

05:44.040 --> 05:45.720
I feel sorry for her.

05:46.320 --> 05:49.720
And currently,
there is no cure for hemophilia.

05:49.800 --> 05:52.880
Now you know.
So if you’d like to help, go donate.

05:52.960 --> 05:54.480
The details are on this page.

05:54.560 --> 05:55.480
JUNKO, A PITIFUL GENIUS

05:55.560 --> 05:56.520
HELP DONATE TO PROVIDE CARE
AND HEMOPHILIC TREATMENT FOR JUNKO

05:56.600 --> 05:58.920
Donate 200 baht for Junko.

05:59.000 --> 06:01.840
Here's 50 baht
for Junko to have a bright future.

06:01.920 --> 06:05.160
A bright future by donating 50 baht?
Disgusting.

06:05.240 --> 06:06.920
Donating 50 baht every day

06:07.000 --> 06:10.320
is better than donating 100 or 200 baht
while cursing other people.

06:10.400 --> 06:14.160
5,000 BAHT TRANSFERRED

06:14.240 --> 06:18.640
5,000 BAHT TRANSFERRED
TO TEACHER WAAN

06:50.120 --> 06:53.680
You have to be extra careful
when you use sharp tools, you know.

06:58.400 --> 07:01.400
When you get a cut,
you'll be in pain more than others.

07:25.440 --> 07:28.600
Hey! Isn't this the new student
from the same class as you?

07:30.520 --> 07:31.400
Yes.

07:32.960 --> 07:33.960
My name is Nanno.

07:35.360 --> 07:36.440
And what brings you here?

07:36.920 --> 07:38.840
I'm worried about Junko.

07:39.320 --> 07:43.240
I was with her when it happened.
And I saw her…

07:44.640 --> 07:45.800
Don't be shocked.

07:46.360 --> 07:48.320
Junko is a weak kid.

07:48.880 --> 07:50.440
And I have to give her injections daily.

08:25.080 --> 08:26.320
I love you very much.

08:28.000 --> 08:29.560
I won't lose you ever.

08:31.360 --> 08:33.520
Has Junko been like this for a long time?

08:34.360 --> 08:35.320
Since she was little.

08:35.400 --> 08:36.960
I feel sorry.

08:37.880 --> 08:38.799
Yes.

08:38.880 --> 08:42.480
Junko has many difficulties
and she's pitiful.

08:42.559 --> 08:43.919
I meant, sorry for you.

08:50.280 --> 08:52.680
Looking after someone
for the rest of your life,

08:53.160 --> 08:54.920
you must be really weary.

08:55.480 --> 08:57.640
I used to hear people say

08:57.720 --> 09:02.520
that they want to have a child so that
one day, that child will look after them.

09:03.080 --> 09:06.160
But for you, that day will never come.

09:06.960 --> 09:09.280
You must take care of Junko
for the rest of your life,

09:09.840 --> 09:12.320
and Junko won't be able to look after you.

09:16.120 --> 09:19.800
That's not what I have in mind at all.
I can do anything for my child.

09:20.280 --> 09:22.240
All I want is for her to be healthy.

09:26.040 --> 09:28.120
It's time for class. Let's go.

10:01.840 --> 10:02.840
Eat up.

10:42.560 --> 10:43.920
Put it over there.

10:44.000 --> 10:44.880
Yes, ma'am.

10:45.520 --> 10:46.920
In the corner.

10:48.400 --> 10:49.720
-Thank you.
-Sure.

11:02.640 --> 11:03.520
Are you full?

11:04.680 --> 11:05.520
Yes.

13:26.600 --> 13:27.440
Who's there?

13:36.800 --> 13:38.040
Who is it?

14:07.440 --> 14:08.280
You.

14:08.840 --> 14:09.680
Yes?

14:11.480 --> 14:13.520
Are you unwell? Why are you here?

14:14.200 --> 14:15.760
I'm fine.

14:17.400 --> 14:18.880
Then why aren't you in class?

14:21.040 --> 14:22.960
You do know that I'm a new student, right?

14:23.040 --> 14:23.880
Yes.

14:24.640 --> 14:28.760
Actually, the reason I transferred here
was because I wanted to see a teacher.

14:29.760 --> 14:32.160
But since I moved here,
I haven't seen her at all.

14:32.240 --> 14:34.880
And she's supposed to be
here in the infirmary.

14:38.840 --> 14:40.480
Oh, Teacher Supattra?

14:40.560 --> 14:42.760
She quit last semester.

14:42.840 --> 14:44.280
-Really?
-Yes.

14:45.400 --> 14:46.640
Where did she go?

14:48.360 --> 14:52.880
I don't know. It's personal.
And we weren't that close.

14:54.160 --> 14:55.720
You weren't close,

14:56.480 --> 14:59.280
even though you two were
together in the infirmary all along?

15:00.600 --> 15:03.720
Actually, I texted her a lot,
but she never replied.

15:04.600 --> 15:06.480
I didn't know either.

15:06.560 --> 15:08.960
When she moved out,
she didn't even say goodbye.

15:11.200 --> 15:12.840
She left without saying goodbye.

15:13.360 --> 15:17.080
Speaking of teachers,
I haven't seen a lot of them.

15:17.840 --> 15:19.360
For example,

15:21.200 --> 15:22.560
Teacher Khemmaka.

15:23.520 --> 15:25.920
She also teaches Chemistry
like Teacher Supattra.

15:26.880 --> 15:30.040
Teacher Khomkrit, Teacher Teethawat,
Teacher Nalina,

15:30.120 --> 15:32.400
and Teacher Tawanwad.

15:35.200 --> 15:36.720
They've all disappeared.

15:38.760 --> 15:40.400
Well, I don't see it as strange.

15:41.240 --> 15:45.320
Normally, this school has had
many teachers that have come in and out.

15:45.400 --> 15:50.240
When the time comes, when they find
a better place, they just go.

15:50.320 --> 15:51.560
A better place?

15:52.040 --> 15:58.000
Is that place musty, damp,
and salty-smelling?

16:05.440 --> 16:08.040
I meant a beautiful school by the beach.

16:11.520 --> 16:12.880
Well, I guess so.

16:15.960 --> 16:18.400
Everyone wants to move to a better place.

16:18.480 --> 16:20.640
What about you, Teacher Waan?
Don't you want to move too?

16:22.880 --> 16:24.000
I can't go.

16:24.080 --> 16:25.920
Because you have to take care of Junko.

16:28.760 --> 16:30.680
If there's nothing else,
you should get back to class.

16:30.760 --> 16:33.720
Oh, I almost forgot. Actually,

16:34.600 --> 16:36.120
I came to return this to you.

16:36.640 --> 16:38.080
You left it.

16:39.800 --> 16:44.920
At first, I thought it was desmopressin,

16:47.520 --> 16:50.040
which is the medication
for Junko's hemophilia.

16:50.760 --> 16:52.040
Turns out, that's not it.

17:01.720 --> 17:04.280
Here, in this school…

17:04.360 --> 17:07.160
the teachers…
there are lots of weird things.

17:34.720 --> 17:37.440
Teacher Waan, Junko fell in the restroom.

17:38.280 --> 17:39.120
Junko!

18:46.880 --> 18:49.960
What did you inject Junko with
to make her weak?

19:16.760 --> 19:20.120
For those who knew about it,
you killed them.

19:22.960 --> 19:26.320
Should I post it on the internet?

19:39.240 --> 19:41.760
Just exposing her and you're satisfied?

19:45.800 --> 19:50.280
Such a disappointment again.
If it were me, I would kill her.

19:52.600 --> 19:55.240
Wasn't it Teacher Waan
that you saw in your dream?

19:57.360 --> 19:59.200
I received the blood from you,

19:59.800 --> 20:02.200
so we're connected in some way.

20:04.000 --> 20:07.880
Speaking of which,
we're just like a mother and a daughter.

20:10.160 --> 20:11.240
A mother and a daughter?

20:14.640 --> 20:18.880
Kill and kill. Is that the only thing
you can think of?

20:21.560 --> 20:24.480
That dream will never come true.

20:26.320 --> 20:29.400
You might be sorry for believing that way.

20:34.040 --> 20:36.320
TEACHER WAAN: LET'S HAVE A TALK.

21:09.400 --> 21:11.280
Do you think others will believe you?

21:12.200 --> 21:14.840
All the evidence is inside Junko.

21:14.920 --> 21:17.480
And the bodies are still in your house.

21:18.320 --> 21:22.760
Feeding on people's compassion.
Is it that easy?

21:24.600 --> 21:27.680
You don't know a thing.
You don't have a say in this.

21:28.520 --> 21:29.560
Not know anything?

21:30.160 --> 21:34.040
Like, not knowing that
a teacher's salary is not enough

21:34.520 --> 21:38.440
that you had to hurt your own kid
to fool other people for money?

21:39.400 --> 21:40.720
Something like that?

21:43.320 --> 21:46.640
I think It's time…

21:47.400 --> 21:50.720
that you get your punishment
for the things that you did.

21:50.800 --> 21:52.000
What are you doing?

22:10.480 --> 22:12.120
Don't worry, Teacher.

22:13.120 --> 22:15.640
I won't punish you myself.

22:16.640 --> 22:19.840
There are so many people
who are willing to do it.

22:20.640 --> 22:21.640
Don't!

22:23.080 --> 22:24.720
The money that I'm saving

22:24.800 --> 22:26.680
is the indemnity
for the dead teachers' families.

22:29.320 --> 22:31.040
By drugging Junko?

22:31.120 --> 22:34.200
The reason I did all that
wasn't for myself.

22:35.840 --> 22:37.360
I did it for everyone.

22:39.120 --> 22:40.600
Because Junko is a monster.

22:42.280 --> 22:43.840
She's the one who killed those people.

22:47.600 --> 22:49.680
Junko's had some complex disorder
since she was little.

22:51.600 --> 22:55.000
She was a weak kid,
and she got bullied by her classmates.

22:59.360 --> 23:01.760
Look at her! Get up!

23:02.240 --> 23:05.080
-What's happening?
-Teacher, help me.

23:05.160 --> 23:06.880
They picked on me.

23:10.760 --> 23:15.160
We just wanted Junko
to be able to help herself.

23:17.360 --> 23:20.320
Junko, don't be a burden to other people.

23:24.080 --> 23:27.360
Junko hates her school, her friends…

23:27.880 --> 23:29.200
She hates everyone.

23:30.360 --> 23:33.240
She told me she wouldn't go to school
until her legs were treated.

23:36.760 --> 23:40.720
Back then, she spent time in her room
with her obsession.

23:43.000 --> 23:45.320
And the only thing that got her interest

23:46.880 --> 23:48.400
was the human body.

23:53.160 --> 23:56.040
At first, I thought it would be fine.

23:58.680 --> 24:01.760
But one day,
when she could finally walk again,

24:01.840 --> 24:02.840
I found out that…

24:02.920 --> 24:05.120
What did you want to show me, Junko?

24:05.200 --> 24:08.000
If it's not cool, I won't play with you.

24:12.480 --> 24:13.640
I brought you some snack--

24:18.200 --> 24:20.760
Mom, isn't this beautiful?

24:48.720 --> 24:51.920
I tried to make it look like
everyone was missing…

25:04.080 --> 25:05.600
in order to protect Junko,

25:10.160 --> 25:11.640
and everyone else.

25:19.840 --> 25:21.520
So, I had to give her the injections

25:21.600 --> 25:24.040
so she would be
in no condition to kill anyone.

25:32.400 --> 25:34.840
I tried my best as a mother.

25:37.760 --> 25:39.160
If it hadn't been for me,

25:39.760 --> 25:41.640
Junko would've gone out there
and killed another.

25:43.240 --> 25:44.840
As a mother?

25:45.960 --> 25:47.760
Are you saying these words

25:48.360 --> 25:50.120
in order to justify yourself?

25:50.200 --> 25:52.280
There's no such thing
as justification whatsoever.

25:55.240 --> 25:56.960
Junko really is a monster.

26:01.760 --> 26:05.480
So you heard all of it, right, Junko?
Your mother drugged you.

26:08.600 --> 26:09.760
Junko.

26:12.000 --> 26:15.160
I've told you.
Your mother can't be trusted.

26:15.240 --> 26:16.200
Who are you?

26:17.600 --> 26:19.000
I'm Junko's friend.

26:19.080 --> 26:20.200
A friend?

26:20.280 --> 26:21.800
A close one too.

26:21.880 --> 26:23.840
We're close enough to know everything,

26:23.920 --> 26:25.480
and I've been helping her.

26:25.560 --> 26:26.520
Helping her with what?

26:31.280 --> 26:33.360
You've been the victim all your life.

26:33.920 --> 26:36.920
Who were they to judge us?

26:39.480 --> 26:41.600
From now on,
it won't be like that anymore.

26:59.440 --> 27:03.760
I'm sorry, but it was necessary.
I don't want you to kill anybody else.

27:06.160 --> 27:08.080
Those people deserved to die.

27:11.640 --> 27:13.760
The friends who bullied me all day…

27:15.720 --> 27:17.360
Go get your wheelchair, go!

27:18.520 --> 27:21.000
So, your gut…

27:21.080 --> 27:22.840
The teacher who didn't help

27:23.880 --> 27:26.160
and also told me
that I was the school's burden…

27:27.560 --> 27:28.880
I just wanted revenge.

27:31.360 --> 27:33.440
Yuri told me it's the right of the victim.

27:37.760 --> 27:39.200
So why are you hurting me?

27:39.680 --> 27:41.520
I never thought of hurting you, Junko.

27:42.240 --> 27:44.000
I did it just to protect you.

27:44.080 --> 27:45.080
Protect me?

27:45.960 --> 27:48.440
All this time,
we've been doing well on our own.

27:48.520 --> 27:51.320
And these people,
they came to destroy our normality.

27:51.400 --> 27:53.920
My normality is killing someone.

27:58.560 --> 28:00.320
And you took that away.

28:16.680 --> 28:18.960
I've been changing
the injections for a while.

28:19.040 --> 28:22.160
Instead of yours,
I've changed them into vitamins.

28:23.560 --> 28:27.520
So Junko's weakness,
you see, is actually just…

28:28.080 --> 28:29.400
…an act, Mom.

28:45.160 --> 28:46.120
Junko.

29:08.120 --> 29:09.120
Junko!

29:28.880 --> 29:29.920
Junko.

29:30.760 --> 29:32.000
I'm your mom.

29:32.960 --> 29:34.520
What you did wasn't what a mom would do.

29:36.240 --> 29:37.840
So what should we do now?

29:37.920 --> 29:40.560
Should we let the daughter
kill her own mother? Or what should we do…

29:40.640 --> 29:41.680
Mom?

29:56.440 --> 30:01.040
If you knew that Junko was a real killer,
why would you help her?

30:01.120 --> 30:04.400
In the past, you'd been handling
the wrongdoers like I had.

30:04.920 --> 30:06.640
Just with different methods.

30:16.760 --> 30:17.600
Junko.

30:18.840 --> 30:20.880
Don't leave me with no choice.

30:21.360 --> 30:24.360
Junko has been the victim all her life.

30:24.440 --> 30:26.920
So, she stands up for revenge, like me.

30:29.600 --> 30:31.400
With a person like you or Junko,

30:31.880 --> 30:34.840
it's hard to tell
whether you're the victim or not.

30:36.960 --> 30:39.560
I guess it's just as hard to tell
who's wrong…

30:40.600 --> 30:43.640
Teacher Waan who crippled Junko
so she wouldn't be able to kill anybody,

30:44.200 --> 30:47.960
or Junko, who took it all out
on the ones who did her wrong.

30:48.600 --> 30:50.240
Nanno, can you really be
the judge of that?

30:50.800 --> 30:51.800
Who's the wrong one?

30:53.400 --> 30:56.040
Is this how grateful you are
that I let you live

30:56.120 --> 30:57.760
and not cause any more trouble?

30:58.720 --> 31:01.680
You didn't have to go to jail,
live behind bars,

31:01.760 --> 31:03.640
be a sinner for your whole life.

31:04.200 --> 31:06.600
That's because
I've cleared everything for you.

31:06.680 --> 31:08.760
But instead of showing some gratitude,

31:09.320 --> 31:10.760
you're now defying me?

31:40.200 --> 31:41.120
Junko.

31:42.120 --> 31:46.160
Please stop. I'm sorry.

31:53.720 --> 31:55.520
I love you, Junko.

31:58.920 --> 32:00.160
Junko.

32:19.880 --> 32:20.920
Mom.

32:24.280 --> 32:25.280
Junko.

32:35.440 --> 32:37.640
You like to call me a monster, don't you?

32:39.400 --> 32:40.400
What?

32:43.600 --> 32:45.920
Prove your motherhood.

32:47.040 --> 32:49.440
The mother is about to get killed
by her own daughter.

32:55.080 --> 33:01.120
I can't let you live without a mother.

33:04.440 --> 33:06.040
I'm sorry.

34:44.280 --> 34:47.080
So can you tell now who the wrong one is?

36:45.480 --> 36:47.120
Why did you have to interfere?

36:47.680 --> 36:50.800
This is the secret between Junko and me.
Understood?

36:51.360 --> 36:53.080
Understood?

36:55.600 --> 36:59.360
Human iniquity is too complicated.

37:02.320 --> 37:06.520
Even love can be used
as an excuse for selfishness.

37:10.400 --> 37:11.760
I'm sorry.

37:12.240 --> 37:14.520
This is human.

39:11.360 --> 39:12.760
It's the end of your era, Nanno.

39:32.160 --> 39:36.400
I'll give this to everyone
and let themselves be the judge.

40:04.000 --> 40:05.040
Bye-bye, Nanno.

40:07.400 --> 40:10.720
What will the world be like after this?
Seems fun.

41:11.520 --> 41:13.720
A world without any resistance…

41:15.800 --> 41:18.280
A world where everyone is the judge…

41:19.800 --> 41:21.400
In a world after this…

41:23.040 --> 41:26.440
is Nanno still needed?

42:57.320 --> 43:02.320
Subtitle translation by:
Tanada Hantaweewatana
